msgid "This book can only be opened in the Libby app or on a Kindle device.\n\nThe publisher does not provide a downloadable EPUB or PDF file for KOReader.\n\nTo read this book, open it in the Libby app on your phone/tablet/computer or choose 'Read with Kindle' on libbyapp.com."
