# en-hash: 85d9b790cf92db1259c444be28a178bc
msgid "This book cannot be downloaded to KOReader.\n\nLibby only provides this title in formats for the Libby app or Kindle devices. Downloadable EPUB/PDF files are not available for this loan from the library."
